    {"id":"q067","type":"pattern-data","difficulty":2,"category":"applied","story":{"title":"预测下一轮声呐数据","body":"三轮记录分别是5、10、15条数据，数量每轮增加5条。下一轮记录多少条？"},"requiresFiveStep":true,"steps":[{"type":"known","prompt":"前三轮记录是5、10、15条数据。"},{"type":"unknown","prompt":"求下一轮记录的数据条数。"},{"type":"relation","prompt":"每轮比上一轮多5条。"},{"type":"expression","prompt":"列式：15 + 5。"},{"type":"answer","prompt":"算出下一轮条数，并核对每次多5。"}],"hints":["把记录按顺序读一遍，想想规律是什么。","已知最后一轮记录15条。","每两轮之间都多5条。","列式：15 + 5。","比如另一组是2、4、6，每轮多2，下一轮就从6推到8。"],"answer":{"value":20,"unit":"条"},"similarQuestionIds":[],"tags":["pattern-data","increasing-pattern","difficulty-2","application","skill-constant-difference-sequence","standard:3.OA.9"],"creatureRef":"johnson-anglerfish","sources":["https://www.thecorestandards.org/Math/Content/3/OA/"]},
