    {"id":"q069","type":"pattern-data","difficulty":3,"category":"basic","story":{"title":"分析递增观测序列","body":"序列是4、7、13、22、34，相邻两数依次增加3、6、9、12。下一个数是多少？"},"requiresFiveStep":false,"hints":["先观察相邻两数的差。","已知差依次为3、6、9、12。","这些差每次增加3，所以下一个差是15。","用34 + 15求下一个数。","比如序列2、5、9、14，差是3、4、5，下一个差就是6。"],"answer":{"value":49,"unit":"个"},"similarQuestionIds":[],"tags":["pattern-data","difference-pattern","difficulty-3","skill-second-difference-sequence","standard:3.OA.9"],"creatureRef":"deep-sea-lizardfish","sources":["https://www.thecorestandards.org/Math/Content/3/OA/"]},
    {"id":"q070","type":"pattern-data","difficulty":3,"category":"basic","story":{"title":"补全平方数量表","body":"某数量表依次记录4、9、16、25，每次分别是2×2、3×3、4×4、5×5。下一项是多少？"},"requiresFiveStep":false,"hints":["把每个数看成相同两个数相乘。","记录依次是2×2、3×3、4×4、5×5。","下一个是6×6。","计算6 × 6。","比如3×3、4×4、5×5，下一个就是6×6这样推算。"],"answer":{"value":36,"unit":"个"},"similarQuestionIds":[],"tags":["pattern-data","square-numbers","difficulty-3","skill-square-number-sequence","standard:3.OA.9"],"creatureRef":"jewel-squid","sources":["https://www.thecorestandards.org/Math/Content/3/OA/"]},
    {"id":"q071","type":"pattern-data","difficulty":3,"category":"applied","story":{"title":"破解训练能量序列","body":"训练器能量显示2、5、11、23，每一步都是前一个数的2倍再加1。下一项是多少？"},"requiresFiveStep":true,"steps":[{"type":"known","prompt":"已有能量值2、5、11、23。"},{"type":"unknown","prompt":"求下一步的能量值。"},{"type":"relation","prompt":"规则是前一个数乘2，再加1。"},{"type":"expression","prompt":"列式：23 × 2 + 1。"},{"type":"answer","prompt":"先乘再加，检查是否符合规则。"}],"hints":["读出前四项并找共同规则。","已知最后一项是23。","每项由前一项乘2再加1得到。","列式：23 × 2 + 1。","比如前一项是9：9 × 2 + 1，就得到后一项。"],"answer":{"value":47,"unit":"个"},"similarQuestionIds":[],"tags":["pattern-data","rule-based","difficulty-3","application","skill-double-and-add-one-sequence","standard:3.OA.9"],"creatureRef":"johnson-anglerfish","sources":["https://www.thecorestandards.org/Math/Content/3/OA/"]},
